    <h3>24.4 Istilah Keselamatan &amp; Pematuhan</h3>
    <div class="glossary-grid">
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>RBAC</strong><span>Role-Based Access Control — kawalan akses berdasarkan peranan</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>ABAC</strong><span>Attribute-Based Access Control — kawalan akses berdasarkan atribut</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>IAM</strong><span>Identity and Access Management — pengurusan identiti dan akses</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>PII</strong><span>Personally Identifiable Information — maklumat pengenalan peribadi</span></div>
