    <h3>24.5 Istilah Kewangan &amp; Operasi</h3>
    <div class="glossary-grid">
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>FinOps</strong><span>Financial Operations — disiplin pengurusan kos awan</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>TCO</strong><span>Total Cost of Ownership — jumlah kos pemilikan</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>KPI</strong><span>Key Performance Indicator — petunjuk prestasi utama</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>MTTR</strong><span>Mean Time To Recovery — purata masa pemulihan</span></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><strong>MTBF</strong><span>Mean Time Between Failures — purata masa antara kegagalan</span></div>
