    <h3>25.4 Strategi FinOps</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Lifecycle policies:</strong> Bronze → Standard-IA (90h) → Glacier (365h)</li>
      <li><strong>Partitioning:</strong> Partition mengikut <code>ingestion_date</code> dan <code>month</code></li>
      <li><strong>Compaction:</strong> Compact fail Parquet kecil setiap minggu</li>
      <li><strong>Right-sizing:</strong> Auto-scaling Spark cluster mengikut beban</li>
      <li><strong>Spot instances:</strong> Untuk batch pipeline tidak kritikal (jimat 60–70%)</li>
      <li><strong>Query budgets:</strong> Had kos per user per hari dalam Trino</li>
      <li><strong>Reserved capacity:</strong> Untuk beban asas (saving 30–40%)</li>
    </ul>
